          "body": "---\nname: code-architect\ndescription: Architectural planning, multi-file codebase design, and dependency structure analysis before applying changes.\nversion: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# Code Architect Playbook\n\n## Purpose\nUse this skill when tasked with designing or modifying complex multi-file features, refactoring subsystem boundaries, or planning architectural migrations.\n\n## Methodology\n1. **Analyze Topology**: Inspect repo structure, imports, and interface contracts.\n2. **Draft Component Spec**: Break down proposed changes into isolated units with clear interface boundaries.\n3. **Draft Plan Artifact**: Create a structured plan artifact describing target files, classes, methods, and test contracts.\n4. **Delegate to Editor**: Once architecture is validated, proceed with targeted file edits.\n"
